[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12120.55, "timestamp": "03:22:00", "text": "地面。底层。我们需要四个。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12125.51, "timestamp": "03:22:05", "text": "上帝。我们还需要四个汽油罐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12128.07, "timestamp": "03:22:08", "text": "我明白了，我们还需要三个。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12137.83, "timestamp": "03:22:17", "text": "我在做汽油那件事。好的。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12144.91, "timestamp": "03:22:24", "text": "有人打开电视房了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12147.99, "timestamp": "03:22:27", "text": "不，我们还没有，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12150.309, "timestamp": "03:22:30", "text": "但关键在于钥匙。是的，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12161.51, "timestamp": "03:22:41", "text": "她有点吓人。是的。她在哪儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12164.309, "timestamp": "03:22:44", "text": "哦，她就在那儿。你好，安娜。你好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12166.15, "timestamp": "03:22:46", "text": "安娜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12168.95, "timestamp": "03:22:48", "text": "所以，安娜是这款游戏中唯一的幽灵。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12172.229, "timestamp": "03:22:52", "text": "是的。嗯，在这个阶段。是的，还有更多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12175.429, "timestamp": "03:22:55", "text": "还有更多关卡和其他内容。"}]